Package: CV3D
Title: Three-Dimensional Analysis of Compound-Eye Surface Geometry
Description: Tools for extracting and analysing compound-eye geometry from
    three-dimensional surface meshes. The workflow quantifies local surface
    height, identifies facet centres, estimates facet neighbourhoods and facet
    sizes, calculates facet surface normals and local optical properties,
    aligns eye data to anatomical landmarks, and projects viewing directions
    onto a spherical field of view.
